  1428                              <1> ; (a loop skips the same false block on every pass), so the first scan from
  1429                              <1> ; each place is remembered: 64 entries of {start, end} at skc, found by the
  1430                              <1> ; start's low 6 bits. Only skips that start inside the program text are kept
